---
import '../styles/global.css';
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Richiedi un preventivo gratuito | Poliurea System" description="Raccontaci del tuo intervento in cinque semplici passaggi e richiedi un sopralluogo gratuito." activePath="/preventivo">
    <div class="quote-page">
        <div class="quote-header-note"><span class="online-dot"></span> Consulenza gratuita e senza impegno</div>

    <section class="page-content">
        <section class="intro">
            <p class="eyebrow">IL TUO PROGETTO, AL SICURO</p>
            <h1>Un problema di infiltrazioni?<br /><span>Troviamo insieme la soluzione.</span></h1>
            <p class="intro-copy">Raccontaci di cosa hai bisogno: bastano pochi passaggi per richiedere un sopralluogo gratuito.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="wizard-card" aria-label="Richiesta preventivo">
            <div class="wizard-top">
                <div class="progress-label">
                    <span id="step-label">Passo 1 di 5</span>
                    <span class="time-label"><span aria-hidden="true">◷</span> Circa 1 minuto</span>
                </div>
                <div class="progress-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="Avanzamento modulo" aria-valuemin="1" aria-valuemax="5" aria-valuenow="1">
                    <span id="progress-fill"></span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <form id="form-preventivo" novalidate>
                <input type="hidden" name="tipo_immobile" id="tipo_immobile" />
                <input type="hidden" name="area_intervento" id="area_intervento" />
                <input type="hidden" name="situazione" id="situazione" />
                <input type="hidden" name="metratura" id="metratura" />

                <section class="wizard-step is-active" data-step="1" aria-labelledby="step-title-1">
                    <p class="step-kicker">PARTIAMO DALLE BASI</p>
                    <h2 id="step-title-1" tabindex="-1">Che tipo di immobile è?</h2>
                    <p class="step-copy">Così possiamo orientarci sulla soluzione più adatta.</p>
                    <div class="choice-grid choice-grid-3">
                        <button class="choice-card" type="button" data-choice="tipo_immobile" data-value="Condominio" aria-pressed="false">
                            <span class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">▥</span><span class="choice-title">Condominio</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="choice-card" type="button" data-choice="tipo_immobile" data-value="Casa indipendente" aria-pressed="false">
                            <span class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><span class="choice-title">Casa indipendente</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="choice-card" type="button" data-choice="tipo_immobile" data-value="Capannone industriale" aria-pressed="false">
                            <span class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</span><span class="choice-title">Capannone industriale</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="field-error" id="choice-error-1" aria-live="polite"></p>
                </section>

                <section class="wizard-step" data-step="2" aria-labelledby="step-title-2" hidden>
                    <p class="step-kicker">DOVE INTERVENIRE</p>
                    <h2 id="step-title-2" tabindex="-1">Qual è l’area interessata?</h2>
                    <p class="step-copy">Seleziona la zona che vuoi far controllare.</p>
                    <div class="choice-grid choice-grid-4">
                        <button class="choice-card" type="button" data-choice="area_intervento" data-value="Terrazzi / Balconi" aria-pressed="false">
                            <span class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">▱</span><span class="choice-title">Terrazzi<br />e balconi</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="choice-card" type="button" data-choice="area_intervento" data-value="Tetti / Sottotetto" aria-pressed="false">
                            <span class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><span class="choice-title">Tetti<br />e sottotetto</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="choice-card" type="button" data-choice="area_intervento" data-value="Fondazioni / Cantine" aria-pressed="false">
                            <span class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">▦</span><span class="choice-title">Fondazioni<br />e cantine</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="choice-card" type="button" data-choice="area_intervento" data-value="Altro" aria-pressed="false">
                            <span class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">＋</span><span class="choice-title">Altro</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="field-error" id="choice-error-2" aria-live="polite"></p>
                </section>

                <section class="wizard-step" data-step="3" aria-labelledby="step-title-3" hidden>
                    <p class="step-kicker">CAPIAMO LA PRIORITÀ</p>
                    <h2 id="step-title-3" tabindex="-1">Qual è la situazione attuale?</h2>
                    <p class="step-copy">Indicaci a che punto sei: ci aiuta a ricontattarti con le giuste informazioni.</p>
                    <div class="choice-grid choice-grid-3">
                        <button class="choice-card" type="button" data-choice="situazione" data-value="Infiltrazione attiva (emergenza)" aria-pressed="false">
                            <span class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span><span class="choice-title">Infiltrazione attiva</span><span class="choice-caption">Intervento urgente</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="choice-card" type="button" data-choice="situazione" data-value="Manutenzione preventiva" aria-pressed="false">
                            <span class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚒</span><span class="choice-title">Manutenzione preventiva</span><span class="choice-caption">Prevenire è meglio</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="choice-card" type="button" data-choice="situazione" data-value="Nuova costruzione" aria-pressed="false">
                            <span class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">＋</span><span class="choice-title">Nuova costruzione</span><span class="choice-caption">Un progetto da iniziare</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="field-error" id="choice-error-3" aria-live="polite"></p>
                </section>

                <section class="wizard-step" data-step="4" aria-labelledby="step-title-4" hidden>
                    <p class="step-kicker">UN’ULTIMA INFORMAZIONE</p>
                    <h2 id="step-title-4" tabindex="-1">Qual è la superficie da trattare?</h2>
                    <p class="step-copy">Va bene anche una stima approssimativa.</p>
                    <div class="choice-grid choice-grid-3 size-grid">
                        <button class="choice-card size-card" type="button" data-choice="metratura" data-value="&lt; 50 mq" aria-pressed="false">
                            <span class="choice-title">Meno di 50 m<sup>2</sup></span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="choice-card size-card" type="button" data-choice="metratura" data-value="50–150 mq" aria-pressed="false">
                            <span class="choice-title">Da 50 a 150 m<sup>2</sup></span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="choice-card size-card" type="button" data-choice="metratura" data-value="&gt; 150 mq" aria-pressed="false">
                            <span class="choice-title">Oltre 150 m<sup>2</sup></span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="field-error" id="choice-error-4" aria-live="polite"></p>
                </section>

                <section class="wizard-step contact-step" data-step="5" aria-labelledby="step-title-5" hidden>
                    <p class="step-kicker">ULTIMO PASSAGGIO</p>
                    <h2 id="step-title-5" tabindex="-1">I tuoi contatti</h2>
                    <p class="step-copy">Come possiamo ricontattarti per organizzare il sopralluogo?</p>
                    <div class="contact-grid">
                        <label class="form-field">
                            <span>Nome e cognome <b>*</b></span>
                            <input name="nome" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Mario Rossi" minlength="2" maxlength="120" required />
                        </label>
                        <label class="form-field">
                            <span>Telefono <b>*</b></span>
                            <input name="telefono" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="333 123 4567" minlength="6" maxlength="25" pattern="^\+?[0-9\s\-\.\(\)]{6,25}$" required />
                        </label>
                        <label class="form-field">
                            <span>Email <b>*</b></span>
                            <input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="nome@esempio.it" maxlength="254" required />
                        </label>
                        <label class="form-field">
                            <span>Comune dell’intervento <b>*</b></span>
                            <input name="comune" autocomplete="address-level2" placeholder="Es. Milano" minlength="2" maxlength="100" required />
                        </label>
                        <label class="form-field full-field">
                            <span>Note <small>(facoltative)</small></span>
                            <textarea name="messaggio" rows="3" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Descrivi brevemente la situazione, se vuoi."></textarea>
                        </label>
                    </div>

                    <div class="upload-field">
                        <div class="upload-heading"><span aria-hidden="true">▧</span> Foto del problema <small>(facoltative)</small></div>
                        <label class="upload-zone" for="foto">
                            <span class="upload-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↑</span>
                            <span><strong>Seleziona le foto</strong> oppure trascinale qui</span>
                            <small>JPG, PNG o WEBP · massimo 5 foto e 10 MB totali</small>
                            <input id="foto" name="files" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" multiple />
                        </label>
                        <p class="upload-list" id="upload-list" aria-live="polite">Nessuna foto selezionata</p>
                        <p class="field-error" id="upload-error" aria-live="polite"></p>
                    </div>

                    <label class="privacy-check">
                        <input type="checkbox" name="consenso" value="true" required />
                        <span>Ho letto l’<a href="/privacy">informativa privacy</a> e acconsento all’utilizzo dei miei dati per gestire la richiesta e ricontattarmi. <b>*</b></span>
                    </label>
                    <p class="form-error" id="form-error" role="alert"></p>
                </section>

                <div class="wizard-actions">
                    <button class="back-button" id="back-btn" type="button" hidden>← <span>Indietro</span></button>
                    <span class="action-spacer"></span>
                    <button class="next-button" id="next-btn" type="button">Avanti <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
                    <button class="submit-button" id="submit-btn" type="submit" hidden>Richiedi sopralluogo gratuito <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
                </div>
            </form>

            <div class="success-panel" id="success-msg" role="status" hidden>
                <span class="success-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                <p class="step-kicker">RICHIESTA INVIATA</p>
                <h2>Grazie per averci contattato!</h2>
                <p>Abbiamo ricevuto i dettagli. Ti ricontatteremo per organizzare il sopralluogo.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <p class="page-footnote"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Sopralluogo gratuito <span>·</span> Nessun impegno</p>
    </section>

    <script is:inline>
        const form = document.querySelector('#form-preventivo');
        const steps = [...document.querySelectorAll('.wizard-step')];
        const progress = document.querySelector('.progress-track');
        const progressFill = document.querySelector('#progress-fill');
        const stepLabel = document.querySelector('#step-label');
        const backBtn = document.querySelector('#back-btn');
        const nextBtn = document.querySelector('#next-btn');
        const submitBtn = document.querySelector('#submit-btn');
        const fileInput = document.querySelector('#foto');
        const uploadList = document.querySelector('#upload-list');
        const uploadError = document.querySelector('#upload-error');
        const formError = document.querySelector('#form-error');
        const uploadZone = document.querySelector('.upload-zone');
        const maxUploadSize = 10 * 1024 * 1024;
        let currentStep = 1;

        const mostraPasso = (numero) => {
            currentStep = numero;
            steps.forEach((step) => {
                const attivo = Number(step.dataset.step) === numero;
                step.hidden = !attivo;
                step.classList.toggle('is-active', attivo);
            });
            stepLabel.textContent = `Passo ${numero} di ${steps.length}`;
            progressFill.style.width = `${numero / steps.length * 100}%`;
            progress.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', numero);
            backBtn.hidden = numero === 1;
            nextBtn.hidden = numero === steps.length;
            submitBtn.hidden = numero !== steps.length;
            formError.textContent = '';
            if (numero > 1) {
                steps[numero - 1].querySelector('h2').focus();
            }
        };

        document.querySelectorAll('[data-choice]').forEach((button) => {
            button.addEventListener('click', () => {
                const { choice, value } = button.dataset;
                document.querySelector(`#${choice}`).value = value;
                document.querySelectorAll(`[data-choice="${choice}"]`).forEach((option) => {
                    option.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(option === button));
                });
                document.querySelector(`#choice-error-${currentStep}`).textContent = '';
            });
        });

        nextBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const field = ['tipo_immobile', 'area_intervento', 'situazione', 'metratura'][currentStep - 1];
            if (!document.querySelector(`#${field}`).value) {
                document.querySelector(`#choice-error-${currentStep}`).textContent = 'Seleziona un’opzione per continuare.';
                return;
            }
            mostraPasso(currentStep + 1);
        });

        backBtn.addEventListener('click', () => mostraPasso(currentStep - 1));

        const aggiornaFoto = () => {
            const files = [...fileInput.files];
            const totale = files.reduce((somma, file) => somma + file.size, 0);
            const errore = files.length > 5
                ? 'Puoi selezionare al massimo 5 foto.'
                : totale > maxUploadSize
                    ? 'Le foto superano il limite totale di 10 MB.'
                    : '';
            uploadError.textContent = errore;
            fileInput.setCustomValidity(errore);
            uploadList.textContent = files.length
                ? `${files.length} ${files.length === 1 ? 'foto selezionata' : 'foto selezionate'} · ${(totale / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(2)} MB`
                : 'Nessuna foto selezionata';
        };

        fileInput.addEventListener('change', aggiornaFoto);
        for (const evento of ['dragenter', 'dragover']) {
            uploadZone.addEventListener(evento, (event) => {
                event.preventDefault();
                uploadZone.classList.add('is-dragging');
            });
        }
        for (const evento of ['dragleave', 'drop']) {
            uploadZone.addEventListener(evento, (event) => {
                event.preventDefault();
                uploadZone.classList.remove('is-dragging');
            });
        }
        uploadZone.addEventListener('drop', (event) => {
            if (event.dataTransfer?.files) {
                fileInput.files = event.dataTransfer.files;
                aggiornaFoto();
            }
        });

        form.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
            event.preventDefault();
            formError.textContent = '';
            if (!form.reportValidity()) return;

            submitBtn.disabled = true;
            submitBtn.textContent = 'Invio in corso…';
            try {
                const response = await fetch('/api/preventivo', {
                    method: 'POST',
                    body: new FormData(form),
                });
                if (!response.ok) {
                    const result = await response.json().catch(() => ({}));
                    throw new Error(result.detail || `Errore del server (HTTP ${response.status}).`);
                }
                form.hidden = true;
                document.querySelector('#success-msg').hidden = false;
            } catch (error) {
                console.error('Errore durante l’invio della richiesta:', error);
                formError.textContent = error.message || 'Impossibile inviare la richiesta. Riprova tra poco.';
            } finally {
                submitBtn.disabled = false;
                submitBtn.innerHTML = 'Richiedi sopralluogo gratuito <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>';
            }
        });
    </script>

    <style>
        .quote-page {
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: #000000;
            color: #e4e4e7;
            padding-bottom: 3rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .quote-header-note {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin: 2rem auto 0;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            background: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
            color: #38bdf8;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            width: fit-content;
        }
        .online-dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #38bdf8;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.8);
        }
        .page-content {
            width: min(100% - 32px, 760px);
            margin: 24px auto 40px;
        }
        .intro {
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .eyebrow, .step-kicker {
            color: #38bdf8;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.14em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 12px; }
        .intro h1 {
            margin: 0;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
            line-height: 1.2;
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        .intro h1 span { color: #38bdf8; }
        .intro-copy {
            margin: 12px auto 0;
            color: #a1a1aa;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .wizard-card {
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #27272a;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: #18181b;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }
        .wizard-top {
            padding: 24px 30px 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #27272a;
            background: #121215;
        }
        .progress-label {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            color: #38bdf8;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .time-label {
            color: #71717a;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .progress-track {
            height: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-top: 12px;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            background: #09090b;
            border: 1px solid #27272a;
        }
        .progress-track span {
            display: block;
            width: 20%;
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: inherit;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0284c7, #38bdf8);
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.5);
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }
        .wizard-step { padding: 30px 30px 16px; }
        .step-kicker { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 10px; }
        .wizard-step h2, .success-panel h2 {
            margin: 0;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 22px;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .step-copy {
            margin: 8px 0 24px;
            color: #a1a1aa;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .choice-grid { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
        .choice-grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
        .choice-grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
        .choice-card {
            min-height: 115px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-start;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #27272a;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: #09090b;
            color: #e4e4e7;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-align: left;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .choice-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            border-color: #3f3f46;
            background: #18181b;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }
        .choice-card[aria-pressed="true"] {
            border-color: #0284c7;
            background: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.12);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #0284c7, 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.2);
        }
        .choice-icon {
            color: #38bdf8;
            font-size: 22px;
            line-height: 1;
        }
        .choice-title {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        .choice-caption {
            margin-top: -4px;
            color: #71717a;
            font-size: 11px;
        }
        .choice-grid-4 .choice-card { min-height: 115px; padding: 14px; }
        .choice-grid-4 .choice-title { font-size: 12px; }
        .size-grid { margin-top: 28px; }
        .size-card { min-height: 80px; align-items: center; padding: 14px; text-align: center; }
        .size-card .choice-title { font-size: 14px; }
        .size-card sup { font-size: 10px; }
        .field-error { min-height: 16px; margin: 8px 0 0; color: #f87171; font-size: 12px; }
        .contact-step { padding-bottom: 16px; }
        .contact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
        .form-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; color: #d4d4d8; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
        .form-field b, .privacy-check b { color: #38bdf8; }
        .form-field small, .upload-heading small { color: #71717a; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; }
        .form-field input, .form-field textarea {
            width: 100%;
            border: 1px solid #3f3f46;
            border-radius: 10px;
            outline: 0;
            background: #09090b;
            color: #ffffff;
            font: inherit;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 400;
            transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
        }
        .form-field input { height: 44px; padding: 0 14px; }
        .form-field textarea { min-height: 84px; padding: 12px 14px; resize: vertical; }
        .form-field input:focus, .form-field textarea:focus {
            border-color: #0284c7;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.25);
        }
        .form-field input::placeholder, .form-field textarea::placeholder { color: #71717a; }
        .full-field { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
        .upload-field { margin-top: 24px; }
        .upload-heading { margin-bottom: 10px; color: #e4e4e7; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
        .upload-heading > span { margin-right: 6px; color: #38bdf8; font-size: 16px; }
        .upload-zone {
            min-height: 115px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 6px;
            border: 2px dashed #3f3f46;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #09090b;
            color: #a1a1aa;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
            padding: 16px;
        }
        .upload-zone:hover, .upload-zone.is-dragging {
            border-color: #0284c7;
            background: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.08);
        }
        .upload-zone strong { color: #38bdf8; }
        .upload-zone small { color: #71717a; font-size: 10px; }
        .upload-zone input { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0,0,0,0); white-space: nowrap; clip-path: inset(50%); }
        .upload-symbol {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
            color: #38bdf8;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .upload-list { margin: 8px 0 0; color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 11px; }
        .privacy-check {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            color: #a1a1aa;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
